Date: 2026-11-03. Base commit: c163c72613b00305c524da3659afb304eef41f40, plus the M8.3 working-tree changes committed with this log.
Disc: the owner's HDCD disc from docs/validation/hdcd-2026-11-03.log (3 tracks, 14:13; packets that switch nothing on).
Drive 4295303415: PIONEER BDR-XS07U, media 4295303423. Output: Sony Walkman NW-A306 in USB DAC mode, UID AppleUSBAudioEngine:Sony:WALKMAN:<redacted>:1.
